{"id":"5996","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5996_main_cirrus-uncinus-floccus-castellanus-fibratus-and-spissatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张令人惊奇的照片捕捉到了同一天空下5种卷云。主要为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩</span>云种，丝条通常像逗号，顶部成钩或簇，而不是圆形的凸起。</p>\n<p>其它云种分别是（不按特定顺序）：</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛</span>云种，右下方有一些云丝条；</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状</span>云种，地平线中间偏左单独的一行；</p>\n<p>几个地方的絮状云种，尤其是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">这里</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">这里</span>；以及最后</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>云种，右边缘附近有丝般光泽的一些云块。</p>\n<p>卷云是在西边900公里冷锋抵近的首个可见信号。然而，不可将该卷云归类为入侵性，因为它在原地发展，并没有向下延伸至上风地平线。</p>\n<p>卷云向东北方向消散，4-6小时后，锋面云带前沿位于西地平线上。10月13日清晨，该地区出现小雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael C. Hanna","location":"美国，纽约，韦兰","latitude":"纬度: 42° 34' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 77° 35' 24'' W","date":"12 October 2015 1733 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.2"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5996_upper_cirrus-uncinus-floccus-castellanus-fibratus-and-spissatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在西西北100公里的探测显示出两个高度层中的高水汽含量：487 - 465 hPa（5800-6200米）以及407 - 385 hPa（7200-7600米）。 卷状云似乎在6000米以上，而上层的温度范围支持异质成核。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4321_main_cirrus-uncinus-and-cirrus-fibratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>带钩的卷云将其识别为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状</span>云种。还存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛状</span>云种。还可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">飞机凝结尾迹</span>。云在朝不列颠群岛移动的大西洋锋的之前出现。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"在大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国雷丁附近的斯特拉特菲尔德莫蒂默","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 24'' W","date":"18 September 2010 0904 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 3"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4801_main_cirrus-uncinus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这是钩状云类卷云不寻常的例子，因为从几乎正下方看，而不是更常见的侧视或斜视。</p>\n<p>云是白色的，形状像逗号，并且以<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩子</span>或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">簇</span>的形式终止于顶部，其上部不是圆形突起的形式。如果它以圆形突起的形式终止于顶部，则它将被确定为絮状卷云。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera - el Tibidabo i les Planes","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"06 October 2015 1206 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4804_main_circumzenithal-arc-in-cirrus-uncinus_clouds-photometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这里的光晕现象是一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">环天顶弧</span>。这是由太阳光通过<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩卷云</span>中的冰晶折射而形成的。图片顶部有一个细小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷积云</span>。在左下方附近较厚的卷云，暗示着这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密云</span>云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Paulius Beinaravicius","location":"立陶宛Radikiai","latitude":"纬度: 54° 57' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 23° 56' 56'' E","date":"05 May 2015 2006 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.5.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4840_main_cirrus-uncinus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>云是白色的，没有阴影，但有细腻的细丝和斑块，可将其识别为卷云。 一些长的冰晶飘带以簇状结束，这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处云种的典型样子。这个卷云与英国康沃尔郡的一个弱冷锋相关。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 9'' W","date":"24 June 2010 1626 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4849_main_cirrus-uncinus-and-fibratus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>该图像显示了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状</span>云种的例子，其是白色的并且以钩子和的形状结束，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛状云</span>有明显的元素，不以钩或逗号形状结束。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"18 September 2015 1052 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5516_main_cirrus-uncinus-cirrus-floccus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>这是一个有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳白色光泽</span>卷云的典型实例。有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状</span>云种的卷云出现，且有证据显示在钩状云融合处有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>云种在发展。左侧屋脊后侧和上方的云素特别小，可称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷积云</span>；它们还有絮状卷积云所特有的破碎云底。天空以钩卷云为主，因此编码为CH = 1。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，埃克塞特，埃克塞特街 (NW-bound)","latitude":"纬度: 50° 43' 26'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 32' 6'' W","date":"09 August 2013 2040 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.2 4"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4505_main_cirrus-uncinus-with-cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>（注：一天中的时间经估算）</p>\n<p>成簇的卷云，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高度在1以上</span>，正在高空强劲的西北气流中快速地从右下方移向左上方。一些云簇带有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状结构</span>，所有云簇下方都有长长的尾迹。与常见情况一样，位于落日上方远处的卷云似乎与<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>合并，并且在靠近<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地平线</span>时逐渐增厚、降低，转变为蔽光高积云。不断增多的卷云预示着一个快速移动的暖锋正在靠近，该暖锋位于西部1500公里外的一个低压系统中。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.K. Pilsbury","location":"S Cambridgeshire, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 52° 8' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 2' 53'' E","date":"03 November 1978 1800 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 2, CH= 4","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4503_main_cirrus-uncinus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc10\"><p>钩状云的典型外观清晰可见。部分元素在（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>）处呈现钩状；另一些则被相当浓密的云团覆盖，在（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>）处沿对角线方向延伸为或多或少纤细的纤维状尾迹。总体而言，所有尾迹基本平行，但在某些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">区域</span>，孤立的尾迹会以或多或少交织的网状结构相互叠加。扰动气流正沿百慕大高压系统的北缘自西向东经过观测站。新逼近的低压系统的暖锋距离约500公里。</p></div>","copyright":"© J.H. Conover","location":"Milton, Massachusetts, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 42° 14' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 71° 3' 58'' W","date":"24 July 1948 1850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 4","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4499_main_cirrus-uncinus-and-cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc11\"><p>云层位于两个高度。高层是卷云，在（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>）处呈现非常纤细的丝状结构，在（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>）处带有钩状特征，因此该云属为钩卷云而非纤缕卷云。云元素<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">at4&amp;&amp;接近缠结云变种。低层在（&amp;&amp;5</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>）处表现为片状卷层云。该云系正逐步侵入天空。观测站位于低压区边缘，其活跃部分位于西南方的南极洋上空。</p></div>","copyright":"© A.H. Boujon and R. Pommier","location":"Port Martin, Adélie Land, Antarctica","latitude":"纬度: 82° 51' 46'' S","longitude":"经度: 135° 0' 0'' E","date":"25 December 1950 0830 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 5","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}